@base = http://localhost:3000/api/incidents

### Listar todos
GET {{base}}

### Filtrar
GET {{base}}?search=transito&status=resuelto

### GeoJSON
GET {{base}}/geojson

### Obtener por id (registro seed)
GET {{base}}/INC-001

### Crear
# @name create
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "title": "Incidente CRUD",
  "category": "accidente",
  "description": "Registro temporal para validar CRUD",
  "status": "pendiente",
  "location": { "type": "Point", "coordinates": [-101.68, 21.12] }
}
